  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/description",
    "raw": "They don't want us to know.",
    "value": "他们所藏于世人之下的秘密。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Nobody in the known galaxy has any clue what it is, or where it comes from. Possessing strange qualities that enable it to affect reality around it seemingly at random, Protheon remains the most sought resource in existence.",
    "value": "已知星系中，无人知晓它为何物，亦不知其来自何方。源质体具备种种诡异特性，能看似随机地影响周遭现实，因而它依然是现存最令人垂涎的资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Of course, you have likely never before even heard of this material. They don't want you to know the truth. I heard it from someone that worked high up in the Ministry of Knowledge: they theorize that the bizarre element is capable of transcending reality as we know it.",
    "value": "你当然很可能从未听说过这种物质。他们不想让你知道真相。我是从一位曾供职于知识部高层的人士那里听来的：他们的理论是，这种诡异元素能够超越我们所认知的现实。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "What does this mean? Well, my friends, brace yourself: It means that it has touched numerous realities like ours...yet not like ours. And when it crosses those thresholds between worlds, they carry the information and energy from other dimensions along with them.",
    "value": "这意味着什么？好吧，朋友们，做好准备：这意味着它已经接触过无数类似我们这样的现实...却又与我们截然不同。而当它跨越世界之间的那些阈限时，它会将其他维度的信息与能量一并携带而来。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "There is simply no telling what could be accomplished with the substance. I've seen it alter time in minute ways within its sphere of influence. I've seen it affect gravity. I've even seen it repair dead tissue back to living status.",
    "value": "根本无从得知利用这种物质究竟能达成何等伟业。我曾目睹它在自身影响范围内，以微妙的方式扭曲时间。我曾目睹它扰动引力。我甚至曾目睹它将死亡的组织修复至生机勃勃的状态。"
